windowed read / edit-lint (MIT), LooppooL and worker-bridge independent verification
(MIT), Grok Workhorse guard rules (MIT), jcode checkpoint notes (MIT), Qoder memory docs.
M2 (no code copied): mini-swe-agent DefaultAgent loop shape and consecutive-format-error
limit (agentkit/worker.py); LooppooL compactToolResults "fold old tool outputs, keep recent
steps" and per-task USD budget (agentkit/worker.py, agentkit/tasks.py); Grok Workhorse
delegate/wait/result, recover-on-restart (running -> interrupted), /proc PID-reuse guard and
commitsSince-style "worker committed" check (agentkit/tasks.py); worker-bridge per-task
worktree, independent verification and escaping_paths symlink check (agentkit/tasks.py).
C-08 (no code copied): OmniRoute (MIT) session-dedup, progressiveAging.ts, toolResultCompressor.ts,
validation.ts, prefixFreeze / cache-aware config and output-style ("caveman" terse) ideas
(agentkit/context.py, agentkit/compress.py, agentkit/worker.py); RTK (Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk) command-aware filters as data with inline tests and raw-output recovery.

